#. Tag: title
#: mouse.docbook:1
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the mouse"
msgstr "Uso do rato"

#. Tag: title
#: mouse.docbook:3
#, no-c-format
msgid "Panning with the mouse"
msgstr "Desprazar a imaxe co rato"

#. Tag: para
#: mouse.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Holding down the left mouse button on an image allows you to scroll the "
"image."
msgstr "Premer unha imaxe co botón primario do rato permite desprazala."

#. Tag: para
#: mouse.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "The mouse wheel will scroll the image up and down."
msgstr "A rodiña do rato despraza a imaxe para riba e para baixo."

#. Tag: title
#: mouse.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zooming with the mouse"
msgstr "Ampliar co rato"

#. Tag: para
#: mouse.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Clicking the middle mouse button will toggle the auto zoom on/off."
msgstr "Premer co botón do medio do rato conmuta a ampliación automática."

#. Tag: para
#: mouse.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hold down the Control key, then either use the mouse wheel to zoom in and "
"out or left click to zoom in and right click to zoom out."
msgstr ""
"Manteña premida a tecla Control e empregue a rodiña do rato para alonxar ou "
"afastar a imaxe ou o botón primario do rato para achegar e o secundario para "
"alonxar."

#. Tag: para
#: mouse.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The mouse wheel, used while holding down the Alt key, will scroll the image "
"horizontally."
msgstr ""
"A rodiña do rato, empregada coa tecla Alt premida, despraza a imaxe "
"horizontalmente."

#. Tag: title
#: mouse.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Browsing with the mouse"
msgstr "Navegación co rato"

#. Tag: para
#: mouse.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When in Browse mode, clicking an image switches into View mode and shows "
"that image."
msgstr ""
"No modo Navegación, premer unha imaxe leva ao modo Vista e mostra esa imaxe."

#. Tag: para
#: mouse.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When in Browse mode, scrolling the mouse wheel will scroll up or down the "
"thumbail view area."
msgstr ""
"No modo Navegación, mover a rodiña do rato despraza a área da vista das "
"miniaturas para riba ou para baixo."

#. Tag: para
#: mouse.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the Mouse Behaviour option in <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;</guimenuitem></menuchoice> is set "
"to Browse, scrolling the mouse wheel while in View Mode will move you "
"through the images in the folder."
msgstr ""
"Se a opción Comportamento do rato de <menuchoice><guimenu>Configuración</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configurar &kappname;</guimenuitem></menuchoice> é "
"Navegar, ao mover a rodiña do rato no modo Vista vaise pasando polas imaxes "
"do cartafol."
